OL,3,GNEWSABoy suffers life-threatening
OL,4,Ainjuries in collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child on a bicycle has sustained
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries in a
OL,8,Fcollision with a car.
OL,10,FThe incident involving a red Citroen C4
OL,11,Fhappened on St Martin's Way, Thetford,
OL,12,Fjust before 15:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe boy was airlifted to Addenbrooke's
OL,15,FHospital in Cambridge, where he
OL,16,Fremains, Norfolk Police said.
OL,18,FTwo women in the Citroen, a learner
OL,19,Fdriver in her 30s and a supervising
OL,20,Fpassenger in her 50s, were arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of drug driving and causing
OL,22,Fserious injury by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
